WEBVTT

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:06.980
There is not a single nation in the Centro
that can be self-sufficient.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.740
That is their greatest weakness.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.120
I am against this, Minister Louis.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.910
Balt-Rhein Empire Advisor
Eisenstein

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.500
Why don't we put an end to making war?

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:26.330
Your Imperial Majesty, the Empire
falls deeper into poverty with each passing day.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Ever since Minister Louis came to power,

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.920
military spending has only increased,

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:35.300
which is the biggest cause

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:37.050
of our current state of poverty.

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:40.470
The Empire's history is a history of aggression.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:44.600
A history which saw our nation
solve poverty through aggression.

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:48.310
When I was your age,

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:52.610
I also believed in our glorious history,
never once doubting it. But times have changed.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:55.110
Corentin Pino
General of the Balt-Rhein Land Army

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:58.620
Twelve years ago, the Empire
was defeated by Torqye.

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:02.370
That loss was due to our foolish
military strategists, who rushed in

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.830
and invaded without laying any groundwork.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:07.460
Even the impregnable Phoinike can be toppled

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:11.340
if one attacked after laying the proper groundwork.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:13.800
You seem quite confident.

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:15.970
As you are so fond of your strategic moves,

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:18.510
what ever happened to the envoy to Urado?

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.220
Regatul Urado...

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:22.770
If we were able to take them in as a vassal state,

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:26.640
we would have secured a flawless position
to attack Torqye.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:31.020
However, if it failed, it failed.
It does not matter in the end.

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:35.950
Because if our left hand is blocked,
we simply need to reach out with our right.

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.990
Then what happens afterwards?

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.330
After both hands have reached out?

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:45.370
Will we continue to pour a fortune into the army,
and carry on these endless wars

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:48.540
to pay for our expenses?

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:51.710
The endless expansion of our military
and foreign aggression

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:54.380
is our Empire's destiny.

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:57.090
An empire is an insatiable monster.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.890
The least us humans can do

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:04.890
is to try to tame this beast the best we can.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:09.020
In other words, it will die
if it does not continually feed.

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:10.900
Exactly, Your Excellency.

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:13.070
That is not acceptable.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.990
Your Excellency, I implore you to consider reason.

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:18.200
You are dismissed, Eisenstein.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:21.490
These are not the times for your way of thinking.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.830
Your Excellency...

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:26.290
Louis, you are saying that
you have the will and courage

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:29.580
to fully tame this beast?

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:32.790
Show me, then.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:34.630
As you wish.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:37.300
Any objections, Pino?

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:41.430
I am only here to serve Your Excellency's will.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:42.970
That is all, then.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:03:04.030
Altair: A Record of Battles

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.490
If Urado had picked the Empire,

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:26.240
that would've been us down there.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.540
Tughril Pasha.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:34.960
I hope you are convinced

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:39.960
that our kingdom is fully and honestly
committed to Torqye.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.880
Yes, and I am honored.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.800
However, will this action

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:50.350
not give the Empire an excuse to attack you?

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:53.230
I would like to see them try.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.230
We do not fear the Empire.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.560
You can count on Urado to protect Torqye's flank.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.440
Regarding the transport of the sterco,

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:06.660
Torqye's merchants shall carry it
from Bird Beach to Aryiros.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:12.540
As Aryiros doesn't allow any sovereign intervention,
the transport between Aryiros and the Eastern nations...

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.870
I, Niki Al-Bahram, shall be the intermediary.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:20.590
I can just imagine you getting arrested
as soon as you step through Aryiros' gates.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.010
I wouldn't botch it up like that.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:27.640
Niki, I just wanted to thank you
for taking on such a dangerous--

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:30.850
I repay my debts, Mahmut.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:37.980
Your Majesty, we will leave for Torqye tomorrow.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:39.980
Niki!

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:43.990
Look. I had heard that women wear pants in the East,

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.820
so I've made a pair from the fabric
we had in the castle.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.570
You're planning on coming too?

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:52.540
Yes, the Eastern World is the lifeline
to Urado's future.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.960
It is only natural to go greet them in person.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.830
The fourth princess Margit
has hereby been appointed

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:03.500
the Diplomatic Minister
to the various Eastern nations.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:05.970
I look forward to working with you, Niki.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:07.680
Yeah...

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:10.970
I wish you good health.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.100
Yes, and to you all as well.

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:22.060
Venedik regards the Empire as an enemy,

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:24.780
and Urado has become an ally of Torqye.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:30.110
Which means you've managed to protect
Torqye from the Empire on three sides.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:35.410
Now they won't be able to
make a move against Torqye so easily.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:38.250
Yes, however,

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:42.000
I can't imagine that they will back down
without a fight.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:47.550
Meanwhile, trouble was brewing in Venedik.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:52.010
The 11 city-states of the Centro, led by Venedik,

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:55.640
had secretly agreed to overlook
any piracy against Imperial fleets

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.020
conducted by privateer ships.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:01.520
However, there was a nation
which would break this agreement.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:09.240
Naval ships belonging to the Republic of L'isolani
are helping the Imperial trade ships.

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.280
Venedik
Residence of Doge

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.660
It is a clear act of defiance.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:18.040
Those L'isolani individualists.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:22.540
I'm sorry, Brega, but I am
sending you to L'isolani.

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:26.550
Find out what that sly dog D'Oria is up to.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.710
Yes, Doge.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.220
The Republic of L'isolani

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:35.890
For what reason have you broken
our secret agreement, Doge D'Oria?

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:38.100
I am so sorry, Silvestro.

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:40.520
Doge of the Republic of L'isolani
Donatello D'Oria

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:42.940
But that was not L'isolani's intention.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.650
You know how it works here, Silvestro.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:51.240
Our Republic doesn't have
the career insurance your nation has.

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:56.870
In L'isolani, your success and failure
solely comes down to your individual skills.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:00.660
So if there is an opportunity, our merchants
steal customers from each other,

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:04.040
and our soldiers will even sell their services
to a foreign nation.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:08.130
Are you saying the D'Oria family
made an agreement they cannot even keep?

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:11.010
Yes, your anger is understandable.

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.720
Those who made deals with the Empire
shall be punished.

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:18.180
I, Donatello, vow to deal with this matter myself.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.640
Can we really trust him?

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:26.560
The words of a sly dog
must be treated with skepticism.

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:29.690
We have to discover the Doge's true intentions.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.860
Something's happened to Paolo!

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.240
-What is it?
-What happened?

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:35.030
He has the plague! Stay back!

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.740
We'll quarantine him.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:41.290
Damn it, it was Ponente's ship.
They brought the plague with them.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:42.710
The plague...

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:48.790
That was quite the discourse.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.170
You've got that right.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:55.590
A few minutes longer, and I would've leapt at him.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.220
We only need to hold out a little longer.

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:02.640
It won't be long before we won't see
any more Venedician merchants on this sea.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:06.770
With them gone, the D'Oria Family
will become the rulers of the Centro.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:09.610
Their time has come.

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:12.150
You are quite the sly dog.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:16.610
If he's a sly fox, then I had no choice
but to become a sly dog.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:21.790
This is what it means to peacefully protect
your national interests if you are willing to do anything.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:25.580
If we're going to play dirty, let's play dirty.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:30.840
As long as there is a chance we've been infected,
we cannot enter Venedik.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:36.840
If there are no signs of infection for 40 days
after contact, then we are in the clear.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:41.600
Following regulation, our fleet
will stay moored in Lucchino Island.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:46.890
First L'isolani's disobedience, and now the plague?

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.110
It's one bad thing after another.

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:51.610
That's true. However,

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.110
what would be even more troublesome

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.990
is if the plague's outbreak was fabricated.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.740
If we hypothesize that the plague was a lie,

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:03.370
then it would mean that L'isolani
and Ponente are in collusion.

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:07.000
Having sided with Balt-Rhein, of course.

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:09.670
If this hypothesis is correct,

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.960
then the reason for spreading this lie

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:14.420
was to paralyze traffic across the Centro.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:18.260
If the plague was real, then the damage
would be irreversible.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:22.850
Even if this were a ploy, we must halt sea travel.

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:26.770
Whether this plague is true or fabricated,

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:29.770
we are to do everything we can
to prepare for either scenario

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.480
during the 40 days activity in the Centro is halted.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:36.780
L'isolani's hostility towards Venedik...

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.860
Greed has got the best of you, D'Oria.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:46.200
So this is a pasha's residence.

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:49.920
We will attend the Divan tomorrow.
The two of you can stay--

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:52.420
Hi there.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:57.210
I bought this hookah in town, and I quite like it.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.930
-What?
-Oh, right.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.970
I had heard you entered an alliance
with Urado. Congratulations.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.770
Doge. Why? How?

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.270
Please, keep your mischief to a minimum.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:11.770
You'll be arrested for trespassing.

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.650
Your letters only report
the events after they've happened.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.150
So you stay quiet, you traitor.

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.650
My apologies.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:20.200
Mahmut Pasha.

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:22.070
I believe this is a good opportunity.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.580
Birlik Torqye, Regatul Urado, and...

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.700
the Republic of Venedik.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:31.000
If our three nations enter into an official alliance,

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:35.500
we can use it to ask all the nations
and cities of Rumeriana

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.670
to join our alliance against the Empire.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:44.430
Did you come all this way
in order to tell me this yourself?

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:47.560
Nobody trusts Venedik, after all.

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:51.020
You wouldn't take us in if I hadn't, would you?

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:57.070
This is amazing.
That's a palanquin for Urado's King.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:59.990
A king would come himself...?

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:01.240
Of course he would.

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:05.490
I heard that it was Venedik's Doge
who organized this meeting.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:10.870
Sending a delegate would cost him
important political representation.

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:15.000
Prenses! I mean, Sadrazam Aishe!
I am happy to see you well.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:19.000
I'll be going now, Al Sakal.

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.630
Behave yourself while I'm gone.

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:24.390
In just five months after the civil war,

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:27.140
he's managed to make it to an allied conference.

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:32.810
If this works out, we just might actually
be able to stop a war with politics.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:38.020
L'isolani is a Centro nation
whose powers rivals our own,

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.860
and they have joined the Empire.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.990
Before the world is shaken by this news,

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:48.370
our three nations should create an alliance
against the Empire to show Rumeriana our strength.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.290
Very impressive.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:56.130
Word would never even get out about the predicament
Venedik was put in after L'isolani's withdrawal.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:01.960
The Empire's target this time
is clearly Venedik and the Centro.

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:07.140
But to think Venedik would propose
an alliance in this manner.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:09.850
To Torqye, who has had to live with the threat

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:13.270
that coincides with sharing a border with the Empire.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.810
This is a welcome proposal.

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.610
We have no reason to decline.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.070
Nay.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.530
Regatul Urado cannot approve.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:27.070
This Venedik is a duplicitous nation
that would shake your hand with its left

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:30.280
while its right hand is busy clasping the Empire's,

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:34.870
creating insurances to mitigate its losses
however the situation may turn out.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:38.000
They cannot be trusted as allies.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.500
This is a surprise.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:46.630
Having our trustworthiness questioned by Urado,
a nation who swore they would rather die

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:51.140
than get involved with any nation, yet chose to
join forces with Torqye in order to survive.

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:54.140
What is so wrong about creating insurances?

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:56.980
In order for a small city-state like Venedik to survive,

00:13:57.140 --> 00:14:01.360
we do not have the luxury
of following some sort of ideology,

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:03.280
and act so self-righteously.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:06.400
We are no different from you,
who broke 400 years of conviction

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.660
and formed an alliance to save your people,

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:10.950
King of Urado.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:15.450
The Fox of the Centro,
you are a skilled talker, as expected.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.790
Tughril Pasha,

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.880
does Torqye not have reservations
about forming an alliance with this fox?

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.380
-You may respond.
-Thank you.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:30.550
Your Majesty,

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:36.640
the Doge of Venedik is only permitted
to leave the country during times of war.

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:42.480
His presence here is proof of Venedik's
position against the Empire.

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:46.820
And His Majesty came here
to see his potential allies himself

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:51.070
because he is giving this alliance
a serious consideration.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:56.580
Your Majesty, you have chosen to join us in our mission
to stop the Empire's war.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.750
If our three nations form an alliance,

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:04.090
we will be able to block off the Empire
without having to go to war.

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.380
We have just received news.

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:10.180
A large fleet of ships from the Empire and L'isolani

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.890
have just blockaded Phoinike and Tharros.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.010
They've forcefully split the Centro.

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:17.560
That is what they were after from the start.

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:21.850
There is not a single city in the Western Centro
that can take L'isolani on their own.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:27.150
If this blockade isn't stopped, all of the Western Centro
will fall to the Empire.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:31.660
We are too late.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:36.540
The two prominent cities left in the Western Centro

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.830
are Chielo and Golfo.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.290
Should these two surrender,

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:46.340
the other Centro merchant nations will have
no choice but to join the Empire to survive.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.300
But isn't this endeavor a bit risky?

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:50.880
There's a plague going around the Centro, right?

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:54.340
It means the rumors of the plague
was their plan all along.

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:58.180
I knew this already.

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:02.350
I thought a pause in the Centro's activity
would be a good opportunity,

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:07.360
without realizing that making me think that
was his true aim.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.860
Having ordered all of our ships
to withdraw from the Western Centro,

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:13.740
in addition to me having traveled abroad,

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:16.370
is delaying Venedik's initial response.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:21.370
So it seems I have done
exactly as the Empire wished me to.

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:25.330
No, it was not all in vain, Fox of the Centro.

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:31.130
I, Zygmunt, shall pledge to form an alliance
with Torqye and Venedik.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:35.010
All because you came here.

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.600
On this day,

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:42.100
the Torqye Pashalu, Regatul Urado,
and the Republic of Venedik

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:45.480
formed the Tripartite Military Alliance.

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:50.980
With this alliance formed, we have no reason
to feel discouraged.

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:54.150
If we cannot travel by sea, we can send
our forces over land.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.820
Hold on, Zaganos.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.910
A land route is not a trivial matter.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.960
In order to reach the Western Centro from Torqye,

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:06.420
we would have to cross the Cuore di Rumeriana,

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:10.420
a group of lesser states who detest Torqye
and view us as savages.

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:16.430
I particularly can't imagine the Republic of Fiore
would so readily allow us to pass through their nation.

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:21.270
And this would be our first campaign
outside of our territory in Torqye's history.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:28.480
One wrong step, and our first expeditionary force
could become our first invading army.

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:34.860
No, this idea could be a good opportunity
to expand our power.

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:37.950
By spreading the news of our alliance,

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:43.250
we can recruit volunteers from the Cuore di Rumeriana
to fight alongside us as we march to the Centro.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.620
That might be a good idea.

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:48.170
But this is all a bluffing game now.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:51.340
The side that can convince the bystanders
that they are stronger

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.630
will be able to grow in power.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.130
If we can carve a path from Torqye to the Centro,

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:59.640
we will be able to send support
to all cities in the Western Centro.

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:05.640
Then I shall leave the land matter to you
and hurry back to the Centro.

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:09.980
I'm sure the Eastern Centro has been shaken
by this blockade.

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:13.940
It would not be surprising if some are considering
switching to the Empire's side.

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:18.740
Once I unify them,
we will also head West, but by sea.

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.290
Wait, that hurts.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:25.370
Please, hold still.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.410
Why is this necessary?

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:30.380
Your organs will be shredded without it.

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:33.880
Please, be patient with us, Doge Lucio.

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:39.380
Our four carriages and 40 spare horses
shall soon be ready.

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:43.890
If you take these in succession,
you will reach Liman within three days.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:47.850
From there it's just a short trip
on Venedik's famous corsairs.

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:51.150
I'm sorry for depriving you of your carriages like this.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:55.530
We are an equestrian tribe.

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:58.110
We can return faster on horseback.

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:01.620
-There is no need for reservations.
-Thank you.

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:06.160
You understand better than most
what trouble Fiore can be.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.370
Help them however you can.

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:21.720
I will absolutely never become
an equestrian tribesman.

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:26.640
So I guess we're heading south
ahead of everyone else?

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:31.900
Yes, our job is to get the lesser states to open their
castle gates for Torqye before the main forces arrive.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.020
If we can get ahead of the Empire

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:36.780
and bring all the lesser states to our side,

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:39.280
we will still be able to stop the Empire.

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:43.280
I won't let either of our armies get used.

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.330
The purpose of Urado's cavalry is to defend.

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:50.330
We may not be able to send them on this expedition,

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:54.250
but once I return, I shall send them
to help defend Torqye's western border.

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.550
That is reassuring.

00:19:56.750 --> 00:20:01.550
Torqye's first expeditionary forces since our founding.

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:05.850
It has not yet been decided who will lead it.

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:08.810
Do you desire the position, Zaganos?

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:12.190
No, I shall respectfully decline.

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:17.690
I believe my abilities could be
better served elsewhere.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:19.400
Buyuk Pasha.

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:23.280
In that case, I would be honored
to take the responsibility.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.370
Why is that, Halil?

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:28.870
I have so far valued the passion of our youth,

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:30.870
a strong sense of justice,

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:36.500
and an almost naïvely intense desire for peace.

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:44.800
However, it will no longer be good enough to simply
observe their youthful indiscretions from afar.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:50.350
Mahmut Pasha and the new sultans
of the Four Sultanlus are all young.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:53.520
There must be someone to support them.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:58.400
Someone who would never make
any youthful mistakes.

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:08.530
Excuse me.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:12.660
What are you doing?

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.000
Well...

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:18.000
I just thought two arms wouldn't be enough.

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.720
Somewhere near the Dux regionis Scoglio border
Ruby Ovest

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:29.720
-I've never seen the sky this color before.
-It's unsettling.

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:32.810
Captain, look.

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:40.730
February 10th, Year 76 on the Torqyean Calendar.

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:45.240
The forces led by the
Balt-Rhein Land Army General Pino

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:49.240
launched an attack against the Dux regionis Scoglio's
western fortress of Ovest.

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:56.080
The 500 garrisoned Dux regionis Scoglio soldiers
faced an army of 5000.

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:59.880
Ovest fell before the sun could rise.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:05.760
The formation of the Tripartite Military Alliance
and the Empire's invasion of Scoglio.

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:08.970
With these two incidents falling upon this day,

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:12.560
it would become known as the start
of the Great Rumeriana War.

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:17.480
Beginning of the Great War

00:23:48.530 --> 00:23:52.030
It has been a long time, Suleyman.
Who is this cute child you've brought?

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:55.950
Hi there, Caterina. I'm here this time
to seduce this nation of yours.

00:23:56.790 --> 00:23:58.500
Next time, "The Flower's Plan."

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:01.960
I will have to pull out all the stops for you.
